  (text "Voltage ratios: AV = 10/54.2 of its input; PROP = 10/230 of its input.\nAt nominal 9/27 V OV boundary, one shorted top resistor gives 2.80/2.25 V.\nThese calculations do not replace clamp, leakage, settling or partial-rail tests.\nUnused switch channels retain original GND straps; this is not added sensing capacity."
    (at 25.4 223.52 0.0)
    (effects
